WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:11.140 --> 00:00:14.580
Wut Wut WUT IT DO bruthas? It’s
black history month and this week

00:00:14.589 --> 00:00:20.970
we dreamin’ a dream wit A Raisin in
the Sun by Lorraine Hansberry.

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:25.300
It’s round 19-fiddy and da whole
Younger family crammed in to a

00:00:25.310 --> 00:00:29.349
stuffy two-bedroom apartment up in
the south side of Chi-town. Da man

00:00:29.349 --> 00:00:33.610
of da house, Walter strugglin to
stack change wit his scrub-ass job

00:00:33.610 --> 00:00:36.089
as a limo driver, and he barely
cuttin it.

00:00:36.089 --> 00:00:38.820
There’s hope that they might get
outta dat trap, tho, cuz Mama

00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:43.600
Younger bout to get PAID: her hubby
bit da big one, and now a phat

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:48.220
insurance check fo’ 10 Gs is on
it’s way in da mail. Thing is,

00:00:48.220 --> 00:00:52.199
Walter actin’ a fool thinkin dat
money his- he wanna use it to open

00:00:52.199 --> 00:00:56.580
a licka sto’ wit some of his boys.
But Mama ain’t down wit dat devil’s

00:00:56.580 --> 00:01:00.449
bidness- She wanna use dem stacks
fo’ what really matter- sendin

00:01:00.449 --> 00:01:03.729
Walter’s sistah Beneatha to med
school, and buyin a house so

00:01:03.729 --> 00:01:07.390
Walter’s boy Travis can live his
life right, naw I’m sayin?

00:01:07.390 --> 00:01:11.119
Later, some brutha name Joseph
Asagai drop in to chop game at

00:01:11.119 --> 00:01:15.119
Beaneatha. He give Benny all sortsa
sh** fo actin’ white and not reppin

00:01:15.119 --> 00:01:18.710
her African heritage. So he throw
her some Nigerian threadz and call

00:01:18.710 --> 00:01:20.880
her a Yoruba word- Alaiyo.

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:24.689
When dat check finally come, Walter
start fiendin fo’ those ends and

00:01:24.689 --> 00:01:27.960
mama gotta put him in his place
tellin him dat licka sto’ ain’t

00:01:27.960 --> 00:01:30.880
neva’ gonna happen.
sh** gets real when mama go on to

00:01:30.880 --> 00:01:34.670
tell him he best sit his ass down
and talk to his woman Ruth bout da

00:01:34.670 --> 00:01:38.179
abortion she thinkin bout havin’.
But when Walter don’t say nuthin,

00:01:38.179 --> 00:01:42.829
mama gets crunk on his ass and he
jus’ pick up his sh** and bounce.

00:01:42.829 --> 00:01:46.799
Then some rich busta named George
Murchinson come in to holla’ at

00:01:46.799 --> 00:01:50.710
Beneatha. Cept when he see her all
decked in African swag, he like

00:01:50.710 --> 00:01:55.530
“nah girl: go change.” Then Mama
swang in wit da most tho’d news

00:01:55.530 --> 00:01:59.329
eva: she put some money down on a
swoel crib in a hood called

00:01:59.329 --> 00:02:05.249
Clybourne Park. There’s just one
catch- it’s an all white neighborhood

00:02:05.439 --> 00:02:08.580
This fool get his nuts in a bunch when
Beneatha keep tryin to talk to him

00:02:08.580 --> 00:02:11.800
instead of just puttin’ out. He lay
it out real wit her: “Stop trippin

00:02:11.800 --> 00:02:15.660
girl, jus’ look good, and keep yo
mouth shut.” but afta realizin he

00:02:15.660 --> 00:02:17.740
ain’t gettin nowhere, he jus’ peace
out.

00:02:17.740 --> 00:02:21.560
Not long afta, the phone ring and
mama find out Walter been skippin

00:02:21.560 --> 00:02:25.780
work and walkin round town like an
emo piece o sh**. So mama decide to

00:02:25.780 --> 00:02:28.580
let him put on da big boy pants:
she toss him da rest o dat

00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:33.140
insurance money sayin dat as long
as he save 3Gs fo Benny’s schoolin,

00:02:33.140 --> 00:02:34.450
he can look afta’ da rest.

00:02:34.450 --> 00:02:37.420
Da whole family gettin’ geeked bout
movin to tha new spot when some

00:02:37.420 --> 00:02:40.720
honk-asaurus named Karl Linder come
to the door. He tell em da white

00:02:40.720 --> 00:02:44.020
folk of Clybourne park don’t want
no blacks movin in. He try and

00:02:44.020 --> 00:02:46.580
bribe em with some money but da
Youngers tell him where he can

00:02:46.580 --> 00:02:47.260
stick it.

00:02:47.260 --> 00:02:50.610
Things change when errybody get
word that Walter spent da rest of

00:02:50.610 --> 00:02:53.810
his daddy’s money on dat licka
store. Not only dat, but he got

00:02:53.810 --> 00:02:57.450
played by his business padna who
skipped town wit da cheddar. Now

00:02:57.450 --> 00:03:01.010
Beneatha cain’t go to med school
and da Youngers all cashed out

00:03:01.010 --> 00:03:02.060
AGAIN!

00:03:02.060 --> 00:03:05.600
Now dat errything lookin down,
Walter call up dat Linder honkie so

00:03:05.600 --> 00:03:08.910
he can take him up on dat cash. But
mama say “Look if you gonna bend

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:12.160
ova’ fo da man, you gonn have to do
it in front of yo son.” Walter

00:03:12.160 --> 00:03:15.950
think long and hard bout if his
pride got a price. When Linder show

00:03:15.950 --> 00:03:19.550
up again, Walter grow a pair and
send his white- ass packin one

00:03:19.550 --> 00:03:20.570
final time.

00:03:20.570 --> 00:03:23.340
Despite da mess da Youngers gonna
have to deal wit up in Clybourne,

00:03:23.340 --> 00:03:27.640
they gonna do it wit their heads
held high. Ungh!

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:34.040
One of da biggest questions dis
play axin is: How’s a brutha gonna

00:03:34.040 --> 00:03:37.420
go on livin afta’ his dream no
longa possible? Fo da Yonger

00:03:37.420 --> 00:03:40.080
family, da dream of buildin a
righteous life fo their family been

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:43.760
tripped up by all sorts a mess:
mostly racism and oppression. They

00:03:43.760 --> 00:03:47.340
learn da raw truth dat there ain’t
nothin realer than dreams not comin

00:03:47.340 --> 00:03:51.010
true. Like Ruth sayin “life can be
a barrel of disappointments.”

00:03:51.010 --> 00:03:54.810
But fo’ Walter, when yo dream die,
it don’t just dry up like a raisin

00:03:54.810 --> 00:03:58.840
in the sun, it rots and festers...
mo like a turd in the sun.

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:00.600
All dat pain and rejection he

00:04:00.600 --> 00:04:04.570
experienced tryna make it in da
land of the American dream jus’

00:04:04.570 --> 00:04:06.540
turn this fool in to a bitter
hater:

00:04:06.540 --> 00:04:10.850
“And you – ain’t you bitter, man? Ain’t
you just about had it yet? Don’t you see

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:14.260
no stars gleaming
that you can’t reach out and grab?”

00:04:14.260 --> 00:04:18.150
But no matta how much dreams can
burn a brutha, you gotta have em

00:04:18.150 --> 00:04:21.789
yo. Hannsberry droppin images of
food all up in dis text to show dat

00:04:21.789 --> 00:04:25.819
grub ain’t da only thing dat keep
us going- we need dreams too.

00:04:25.819 --> 00:04:28.740
Walter: “That’s it. There you are. Man
say to his woman: I

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:31.819
got me a dream. His woman say: Eat your eggs.

00:04:31.819 --> 00:04:34.479
Man say: I got to take hold
of this here

00:04:34.479 --> 00:04:37.569
world, baby! And a woman will say: Eat your
eggs and go to

00:04:37.569 --> 00:04:40.110
work. Man say: I got to
change my life,

00:04:40.110 --> 00:04:42.710
I’m choking to death, baby! And his woman
say 

00:04:42.710 --> 00:04:44.599
Your eggs is getting cold.” (I.i – 33-34)

00:04:44.599 --> 00:04:48.289
We got da same thang goin on wit
Beneatha- she dreamin real big like

00:04:48.289 --> 00:04:52.060
her brutha. Das why Asagai call her
Alaiyo, which mean “One for Whom

00:04:52.060 --> 00:04:54.020
Bread- food- is not enough”

00:04:54.020 --> 00:04:57.229
Beneatha ain’t only tryna beast
through racism, but also the

00:04:57.229 --> 00:04:59.460
oppression she face fo’ being a
woman.

00:04:59.460 --> 00:05:02.229
Man, you could even say dem three
Younger women reppin a different

00:05:02.229 --> 00:05:06.009
side of womanhood in the 19-
fiddies, each wit their own beef to

00:05:06.009 --> 00:05:09.789
rough through. See, Beneatha da
modern woman tryna do her own thang

00:05:09.789 --> 00:05:13.300
and get her education on- but she
gotta put up wit weak-ass bustas

00:05:13.300 --> 00:05:16.400
like George who jus’ want her to
look good and stay quiet.

00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:19.689
Whereas mama keepin it OG wit her
old school views on God, marriage,

00:05:19.689 --> 00:05:24.020
and what it mean to be a family, so
she get all tore up watchin’ all

00:05:24.020 --> 00:05:27.249
this change round her... Not to
mention Walter almost sellin da

00:05:27.249 --> 00:05:31.349
family pride for a lil bit of
scratch. Mah girl Ruth somewhere in

00:05:31.349 --> 00:05:31.889
da middle.

00:05:31.889 --> 00:05:35.479
And that’s where da play’s ending
leavin us too: somewhere in da

00:05:35.479 --> 00:05:38.800
middle. One da one hand da Youngers
gonna roll up on Clybourne Park

00:05:38.800 --> 00:05:41.779
with their middle fingers in da
air, makin it REAL clear what they

00:05:41.779 --> 00:05:44.699
think bout da haters. But on da
otha hand, they got some true-blue

00:05:44.699 --> 00:05:47.580
heartache to overcome. This thug
like to think it all gonna be

00:05:47.580 --> 00:05:51.870
alright in the end, especially
since Walter finally realize his

00:05:51.870 --> 00:05:53.860
family’s dignity is priceless.

00:05:53.860 --> 00:05:57.499
But not as priceless as hittin dat
subscribe button, padna. See yall

00:05:57.499 --> 00:05:59.069
next week. Deuces.

